Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Same B6 contingency. Left: no response. Right: linear-programming optimiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the outage: demand is served in both runs. Line colours show corridor loading.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Half-hour snapshots advance together. Arrowheads show the direction of electricity flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Surplus Scottish wind is exported over B6 towards England.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspecting SSCO-NORT: flow and capacity come from the API.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,B6 trips at 17:00 UTC on 14 Dec 2025. Scotland is cut off from England.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Scotland is islanded WITH SURPLUS wind and stays supplied. Curtailment shows spare generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No response: all eight England and Wales zones, NORT through SOUT, develop shortfalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The optimiser keeps demand served, with no red overloaded lines throughout the episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:02:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,0 MWh unserved at dashboard precision across the full episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Full episode: 63,917 vs 0 MWh unserved. Costs: £388.5M vs £17.4M.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Optimiser model penalty: £0.0M. Model penalties remain separate from cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,RL policies were also trained; they did not beat the optimiser.
